ed everything will work out fine  however even before entering the magic  Congress sacré is far more skeptical and  she cautions austin not to let his guard  down and you better believe that sucre  was right because the very next panel  shows hand  and indeed both austin sucre were  immediately placed in handcuffs upon  their arrival at the magic congress the  magic congress is apparently the very  center of justice for the clover kingdom  and yet as soon as austin sucre entered  the magic congress they could see what  was really happening the Inquisitor  damnatio Kyra introduces himself and  immediately calls for a hearing for the  crimes of Austin so despite the fact  that asta was summoned there with the  assurance that he just needed to testify  so basically was told that he was just a  witness who can help shed light on the  mysterious events surrounding the elves  and the reincarnation hasta was actually  treated as a criminal as soon as he  entered the building there was never any  intention of hearing a stew out and  trying to understand what really  happened with the elves  instead hasta was identified as a  criminal from the get-go and this  so-called hearing is nothing less than a  full-blown criminal trial against him a  trial that he obviously had no chance to  properly prepare for the people inside  the magic Congress building including  King Augustus Keira clover assume right  away that Austin must be guilty and they  even haunt him for being a low-class  orphan from the forsaken region they  start insulting him for being filthy  low-class garbage without any mana and  at this point the true injustice of the  magic Congress and this entire charade  of justice is revealed despite the fact  that hasta played a major role in  actually rescuing the kingdom from the  devil no one inside the magic Congress  is interested in any of that none of  them are interested in the truth instead  they're all ready to condemn hasta at  the drop of a hat  just because he is not a noble like them  sacré is also accused of being a  criminal because there is no record of  her being born anywhere within the  clover kingdom and the horns on her head  are proved that she dabbled in forbidden  magic but of course we know that there  is no record of sakra because she was  actually born more than five hundred  years ago and the reason she has horns  is because she used forbidden magic in  order to seal away the word magic devil  five hundred years ago which saved the  entire clover kingdom these people  should be thanked  astha and sucre they should be giving  them a parade but instead they are  insulting and berating them  the obnoxious nobles inside the magic  congress have no interest in hearing the  truth and they have no interest in the  fact that both of the individuals that  they are accusing and insulting  literally saved the entire kingdom on  two separate occasions as you can  probably tell these shameless Nobles  definitely made me pretty angry and I  was pretty damned frustrated while  reading through this chapter asta tries  in good faith to explain to everyone  that the magic Knights who had turned  against the kingdom were actually  possessed by elves and that all of this  was orchestrated by the word magic devil  but Asta's words are completely ignored  by the nobles who refuse to listen to  anything he says simply because he is a  commoner at this point the arrogance and  ignorance of the nobles seems a little  over the top in my opinion like we get  it the nobles are stuck up and they  dislike commoners but Tabitha is really  laying it on thick in this scene  if these Nobles were really this stupid  and ignorant all this time the clover  kingdom should have collapsed long ago  imagine ruling a kingdom but being this  misinformed and having no desire  whatsoever to actually get informed  about what's happening in the very  kingdom that you are supposed to be  ruling  sacré is surprised that despite all  julius is hard work in promoting a more  just and fair society there is still so  much prejudice and discrimination even  here in what is supposed to be a court  of law and as I said I'm surprised too  because I find it hard to believe that a  kingdom where the ruling class is so  blatantly incompetent could survive for  this long  damnatio that approaches austin whispers  something to him and it seems that he  does this in a way that no one else can  hear except for hasta damnatio says that  either hasta will be judged for being a  devil or the magic Knights as a whole  will be the ones who will have to  shoulder the dishonor of everything that  happened  hasta again tries to explain what really  happened and how they defeated the devil  and that the devil was behind everything  but them natio asks where is this devil  damnatio demands that asked to provide  actual evidence that the devil was  behind everything but austin Sacre are  unable to do that as a result  damnatio says that if there is no proof  that the devil exists then they will  assume that there was never a devil to  begin with meaning that each person who  turned against the kingdom as a result  of being possessed by an elf will be  punished  damnatio starts out by bringing out  Marie adlai Ghosh's pour an innocent  little sister who is brought out in  front of the magic Congress scared and  in handcuffs  Austin Sacre are shocked to see how low  damnatio is willing to stoop using an  innocent child as a bargaining chip in  order to force a false confession out of  hasta damnatio says that unless they can  prove that a devil exists and was  manipulating the situation Marie will be  assumed to have acted the way she did  out of a grudge she had against the  upper and ruling class for her family's  fall from grace damnatio says that Marie  must be judged and as a bunch of hooded  figures are about to zap her with magic  hasta is forced to intervene he assumes  the black asked the form and protects  Marie from the magic attacks but because  he had to take on this form to do it his  demonic side is revealed asta says that  he doesn't recognize the so-called  Justice of damnatio and the magic  congress in the chapter ends as damnatio  proclaims that they will never see eye  to eye with the likes of a devil we are  told that the battle over the devil is  now beginning and it is pretty clear  where this arc of the story will be  going from here although he was  introduced in the previous chapter and  even then he was pretty sketch in this  chapter damnatio was directly revealed  to be the next villain of the series he  is an Inquisitor type figure who claims  to uphold justice but is in reality  willing to do whatever it takes to get  his own way he simply assumes that what  he is doing is just and he is willing to  do anything no matter how wrong any  moral in order to get his way he  believes that hasta is bad news because  of his connection to a demon and in  order to get a confession out of asta he  is willing to lie mislead and even abuse  an innocent child like Marie  addley we can also see that despite the  best efforts of people like the first  wizard King and Julius prejudice and  discrimination still run rampant in the  black holder Kingdom  and their entire justice system is  clearly a joke at the end of the chapter  I'm left wondering what is going to  happen to Austin now not only do the  nobles already hate him for being a  commoner and an orphan with no mana but  now that he has revealed himself to have  an anti-magic power that is connected to  a demon I can only assume that they are  going to want to see him publicly  executed it seems clear that this new  arc will focus on the internal divisions  within the clover kingdom and especially  the divide between the stuck-up and  willfully ignorant nobles and the people  like hasta Yami Julius marijuana etc the  people who put their lives on the line  to protect the kingdom regardless of  background  damnatio is going to use the corrupt  institutions of the kingdom to try and  destroy asta and anyone who sides with  him and the good people of the kingdom  will have to stand up to damnatio this  could lead to some form of civil  conflict within the clover kingdom  because we know that many of the Royals  and especially the most powerful Royals  like King Kira clover are some of the  worst offenders when it comes to  senseless discrimination so changing  their minds it doesn't seem likely it is  possible that the other Royals who have  more common sense like the Vermillion  family will step in and try to bring the  kingdom back on track but whatever  happens a showdown between the corrupt  ruling elite and the protagonists of the  story who just saved the kingdom from  the devil seems to be imminent  let me know what you guys think are we  heading towards a civil war within the  clover kingdom and if so is this civil  war going to be the thing that motivates  one of the neighboring kingdoms such as  the diamond or spade Kingdom to invade  the clover Kingdom which will eventually  lead to another war arc also what do you  think will happen to Austin now are they  going to try to execute him banish him  torture him let me know down in the  comments it's always a pleasure reading  your input and feedback if you enjoyed  the black clover content on this channel  you want to see more you can leave a  like to let me know and if you happen to  be new to anime uproar please don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications unless you turn on all  notifications you're not gonna be  notified YouTube is gonna bury our  videos and you're going to miss them you  can follow me on twitter and instagram  at  anime uproar for all the latest black  clover news and updates I want to give a  big thank you to all of our anime upper  patrons for supporting our work and  making our videos possible a special  thank you to all of our pro hero to your  patrons including the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  King zelgius and on hell crews on Epic  thank you to all of our the one tier  patrons the ones who stand above all  other clans including baby ray ace  Ingrid ah Aloha Adam Maddy Mac  makoto-kun and keelon and finally at the  pinnacle of interdimensional greatness a  tier reserved only for legends a massive  thank you to Regan Harrison and Lord  Noxon or disciples of Lord we go himself  if you enjoy our videos and you think  they provide value for you consider  supporting us on patreon link in the  description even a single dollar will  give you access to our exclusive patron  only discord and your name will appear  in our videos along with these amazing  people as always thank you guys so much  for watching and until next time see us  bass cowboys  [Music]

